 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** The fabrication time is dominated by the inkjet printing process. Printing a 300x300 pixel layer at high resolution takes significant time, but the method is batch-processable.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** The data structure size is proportional to the number of layers and the resolution per layer. For a 20-layer, 300x300 pixel display, the data is manageable.
